<title>BULGARIA: SOCCER-BULGARIA'S KISHISHEV JOINS BURSASPOR.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BULGARIA'S KISHISHEV JOINS BURSASPOR.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria international striker Radostin Kishishev has been loaned by Neftochimik Bourgas to Bursaspor of Turkey for a fee of $1.6 million.</p>
<p>&quot;Kishishev signed with Bursa last night,&quot; Neftochimik's technical director Bozhidar Todorov said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Kishishev joins compatriots Ivko Ganchev and Kostadin Vidolov at the Turkish club.</p>
</text>
